# Crowdsourced Caller ID & Spam Detection Backend Architecture
**Platform**: Supabase (PostgreSQL 15+ & Deno Edge Functions)  
**Target Audience**: Senior Backend Architects & Android Engineering Teams

---

## 1. System Architecture Overview

```
+------------------+         HTTP GET /api/v1/lookup?phone=+1...         +---------------------+
|  Android Client  | --------------------------------------------------> | Supabase Edge CDN   |
|   App (Caller)   | <-------------------------------------------------- | (Edge Cache <5ms)   |
+------------------+     200 OK / 304 Not Modified (Cached Response)     +---------------------+
        |                                                                           |
        | HTTP POST /api/v1/sync-contacts                                           | Cache Miss
        v                                                                           v
+------------------+                                                     +---------------------+
| Sync Edge Func   | --(Bulk Upsert set-based RPC call)-----------------> | PostgreSQL Engine   |
| (Normalization)  |                                                     | (B-Tree Lookups)    |
+------------------+                                                     +---------------------+
```

